Screening and Sanctions: 
 Maintaining automated screening system uploaded with all international sanction lists as well 
as CBE and HBD internal lists; 
 Prohibiting dealing with listed individuals/entities as per any int ernational and/or local 
sanction program;  
 Screening against PEPs either foreign and/or local including the family and close associates as 
well as adverse media and information; 
 Prohibiting opening and keeping accounts for section 311 designated entities; 

Monitoring and reporting: 
