potential suspicious activity/transaction; 
 Adopting policies, procedures and processe s to review and escalate alerts arising from the 
monitoring of customer's activity/transaction;   
 Reporting suspicious money laundering transactions to FIU according to the applicable laws 
in this regard; 
 Define the process where appropriate for terminating existing customer relationships due to 
financial risk crime; 

